---
globs: members/**/*.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

## Component Class

- always use `inject` to provide dependencies rather than the `constructor`
- use signal-based APIs whenever possible
- when creating new components, always use ChangeDetection.OnPush in the component metadata
- avoid subscribing to observables in the class, instead use other strategies like async pipe in template
- do NOT import the `CommonModule` in the component imports, instead import only explicit modules
